        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Ninga huai e ram gaimei 3)_,",
            "Na guang o guang Immanuel;",
            "He abumang kau ram gai khou,",
            "Neilana puai ni e.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "He nang ramthan gaimei thuan na,",
            "Chingru khou rianramei naguai,",
            "ki ruai kum ma;",
            "He nang tikgun dailiangmei munpuang -",
            "Gaimei 3)_ ai ning liang e,",
            "Ramgai mei 3)_ ning e.",
            "",
            "2. Kandih rianra pui ram khou hei,",
            "Mun puang tuaimei kum tuai sini;",
            "Neilamei ramgai tang pukhou,",
            "Gaina jang thak bam ni.",
            "",
            "3. Man kanmei guang Jisu jan khou,",
            "Jai guang o khiu than lou ngam me,",
            "Kau ramgai Zion namdai khou,",
            "Ai jao bam ni Raguang."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
